stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> RECEIVED
  RECEIVED --> SCHEMA_VALIDATED: exact schema
  SCHEMA_VALIDATED --> SNAPSHOT_VALIDATED: task + nonce + nav + mutation current
  SNAPSHOT_VALIDATED --> TARGET_BOUND: live DOM target matches fingerprint
  TARGET_BOUND --> POLICY_ALLOWED: effect allowed in task/origin scope
  POLICY_ALLOWED --> CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED: consequential or ambiguous
  POLICY_ALLOWED --> REVALIDATED: no confirmation required
  CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED --> CONFIRMED: exact digest, single-use, not expired
  CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED --> CANCELLED: decline / timeout
  CONFIRMED --> REVALIDATED: state and target checked again
  REVALIDATED --> EXECUTING
  EXECUTING --> OUTCOME_VERIFIED
  OUTCOME_VERIFIED --> SUCCEEDED
  RECEIVED --> REJECTED: invalid schema / replay
  SCHEMA_VALIDATED --> STALE: state mismatch
  SNAPSHOT_VALIDATED --> REJECTED: no target binding
  TARGET_BOUND --> REJECTED: policy denies
  CONFIRMED --> STALE: page changed
  EXECUTING --> FAILED: execution error
  OUTCOME_VERIFIED --> FAILED: postcondition mismatch
  SUCCEEDED --> [*]
  REJECTED --> [*]
  STALE --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
